      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795019778193,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Reads the dark blue number of s_B\n    once and keeps it in a register.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 40,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Reads the dark blue number of s_B\n    once and keeps it in a register.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t_101",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 244.44140625,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 74956849,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795019778193,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Multiplies it with each dark red\n    number of s_A, and adds each\n    product to the element of its\n    column in the same row.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 85,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Multiplies it with each dark red\n    number of s_A, and adds each\n    product to the element of its\n    column in the same row.",
